---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { ArrowDownToLine, ArrowUpRight, CirclePlay } from '@lucide/astro';

const release = 'https://github.com/loftwah/prints-desktop/releases/tag/v0.2.0';
const download = 'https://github.com/loftwah/prints-desktop/releases/download/v0.2.0/prints-desktop-0.2.0-macos-arm64.zip';
const screenshot = '/prints-desktop/afterlight-workspace-v0.1.0.jpg';
const site = 'https://github.com/loftwah/prints-desktop';
---
<Base
  title="Prints Desktop"
  description="Open Afterlight, a collection of six speculative landscapes, in a standalone Rust and Rune creative workspace. Browse, shortlist and keep the original files."
  shareImage="/prints-desktop/afterlight-share-v0.1.0.jpg"
  shareAlt="The Last Horizon from the Prints Desktop Afterlight collection, with an orange sun framed by a concrete ring on a volcanic coast."
>
  <article class="prints">
    <header class="prints-hero">
      <div class="hero-heading">
        <img class="prints-mark" src="/prints-desktop/aperture-96.png" width="64" height="64" alt="" />
        <h1>Prints Desktop</h1>
        <p>A native creative workspace for discovering images, finding your favourites and keeping the files you came for.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="download" href={download}><ArrowDownToLine size={18} aria-hidden="true" /> Download for Apple Silicon</a>
        <span>v0.2.0 preview · Afterlight works offline</span>
        <a class="quiet-link" href="#walkthrough"><CirclePlay size={17} aria-hidden="true" /> Watch the walkthrough</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <figure class="workspace">
      <a href={screenshot} aria-label="Open the Prints Desktop workspace screenshot at full size">
        <img src={screenshot} width="1440" height="885" alt="Prints Desktop with The Last Horizon selected. The concrete ring and orange sun fill the central image, with the contact sheet below and the image inspector on the right." fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
      </a>
      <figcaption><strong>Afterlight</strong> <span>The bundled sample collection running in the macOS app.</span></figcaption>
    </figure>

    <section class="prints-section" id="walkthrough" aria-labelledby="walkthrough-title">
      <div class="section-copy">
        <h2 id="walkthrough-title">From contact sheet to full frame.</h2>
        <p>Open Afterlight on first launch. Pick a print, read its creative brief, and download the bundled JPEG through your system’s Save dialog.</p>
        <a class="quiet-link" href={site}>Explore the source <ArrowUpRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
      </div>
      <figure class="walkthrough">
        <video controls playsinline preload="none" poster={screenshot} aria-label="Silent Prints Desktop walkthrough">
          <source src="/prints-desktop/afterlight-walkthrough-v0.1.0.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
        <figcaption>Silent walkthrough recorded with Rune. Select and preview a print, then return to the contact sheet.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="prints-section setup" aria-labelledby="setup-title">
      <div class="section-copy">
        <h2 id="setup-title">Run it on your Mac.</h2>
        <p>Download the ZIP, extract it and open Prints Desktop. The preview was verified on an Apple Silicon Mac.</p>
        <a class="quiet-link" href={release}>Release notes and checksums <ArrowUpRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
      </div>
      <dl>
        <dt>Install the preview</dt>
        <dd>The Apple Silicon package is ad-hoc signed and awaits Apple notarisation. macOS may block a copy downloaded from the web. See the release notes for verification and installation details.</dd>
        <dt>Explore without an account</dt>
        <dd>Afterlight and local image work stay on your device. Exploring the preview uses no Cloudflare resources or model credits.</dd>
        <dt>Connect your Prints library</dt>
        <dd>Use a named Oyster App key scoped to your Prints installation. Browse folders, read prompts and model details, and save original files from the desktop app. <a href="https://docs.fungi.computer/apps/prints">Read the upstream setup guide <ArrowUpRight size={14} aria-hidden="true" /></a></dd>
        <dt>Preview scope</dt>
        <dd>The connected preview opens web Prints for generation. See the release notes for Linux and Windows downloads and platform verification.</dd>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <footer class="prints-credit">
      <p>Built by Loftwah with Rust and Anomaly’s Rune. Prints, Oyster and Darkroom are projects from the Fungi ecosystem. Afterlight is original ImageGen artwork made for this preview.</p>
      <a class="quiet-link" href="https://github.com/loftwah/app-composer/issues/1292">Follow the build <ArrowUpRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prints { --prints-accent: #ffb08c; }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .prints { --prints-accent: #a83920; }

  .prints-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 32px;
    padding: clamp(12px, 2vw, 28px) 0 34px;
  }

  .hero-heading { position: relative; }
  .prints-mark { display: block; width: 56px; height: 56px; margin-left: -6px; }
  .hero-heading h1 {
    margin: 8px 0 14px;
    max-width: none;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7.3vw, 6.35rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -.036em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .hero-heading p { max-width: 51ch; margin: 0; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem); }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; padding-bottom: 2px; }
  .hero-actions span { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: .86rem; }
  .download, .quiet-link, dd a { display: inline-flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
  .download {
    min-height: 48px;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 9px 15px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: #19141b;
    background: #ffc3a7;
    font-size: .94rem;
  }

  .download:hover { background: #ffae88; }
  .quiet-link, dd a { color: var(--prints-accent); }
  .quiet-link { min-height: 44px; font-size: .93rem; }
  .quiet-link:hover, dd a:hover { color: var(--color-foreground); }
  .workspace, .walkthrough { margin: 0; }
  .workspace a { display: block; border-radius: 14px; }
  .workspace img, .walkthrough video {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: #181622;
  }

  .workspace figcaption, .walkthrough figcaption {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 11px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: .9rem;
  }

  .workspace strong { color: var(--color-foreground); }
  .prints-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(24px, 5vw, 66px);
    margin-top: clamp(46px, 7vw, 92px);
    padding-top: clamp(25px, 4vw, 45px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .prints-section h2 { margin: 0 0 14px; text-wrap: balance; }
  .section-copy p, .prints-credit p { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .setup dl { margin: 0; }
  .setup dt { font-weight: 650; }
  .setup dd { margin: 2px 0 16px; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .setup dd:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .prints-credit {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px 26px;
    margin-top: clamp(40px, 6vw, 68px);
    padding-top: 21px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-size: .9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .prints-hero, .prints-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .prints-hero { gap: 18px; padding-bottom: 24px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 390px) {
    .download { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
